  "body": "From relaxed mornings to lively family evenings, this brand-new home brings comfort and thoughtful design to every day.\r\n\r\nAt its heart, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area makes an immediate impression with its high ceiling height. Cook, catch up and entertain in this inviting space, then open the doors to the deck and enjoy dining outdoors.\r\n\r\nThe layout gives everyone room to settle in. A downstairs bedroom and full bathroom welcome guests or extended family, while upstairs, a separate family lounge is the perfect spot to unwind. Three further bedrooms include a master retreat with its own walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\n\r\nEverything you need, beautifully brought together:\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n• Two living areas for family time and quiet moments\r\n• Kitchen island for easy meals and conversation\r\n• Master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n• Family bathroom with a bathtub and separate shower\r\n• Central air conditioning for comfort in every season\r\n• Internal-access garage\r\n• Sunny deck and a peaceful setting\r\n• A desirable north–south orientation\r\n\r\nWith Silverdale’s shops, local schools, motorway connections and Hibiscus Coast beaches within easy reach, there’s plenty to enjoy beyond your front door too.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is ready to sell. Come and discover how easily life could fit here — call for a private viewing or visit our open home.\r\n\r\nVisit our showhome at 25 Tack Road, Silverdale.",
